    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Island Combat</i> is an action-packed game with various difficulty levels, allowing you to adapt and take on challenges. Engage with other players through online chat and utilize a special slow-motion ability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">James lived a peaceful life with his brother on a secluded island until a group of criminals discovered a treasure map from ancient pirates. As news spread, their lives turned chaotic with treasure hunters invading the island. Will you defend your home from these unwanted visitors?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use slow-motion combat skills to control time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time is running out\u2014defend your island!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Island Combat</i> is an action-packed game with various difficulty levels, allowing you to adapt and take on challenges. Engage with other players through online chat and utilize a special slow-motion ability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">James lived a peaceful life with his brother on a secluded island until a group of criminals discovered a treasure map from ancient pirates. As news spread, their lives turned chaotic with treasure hunters invading the island. Will you defend your home from these unwanted visitors?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use slow-motion combat skills to control time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time is running out\u2014defend your island!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Defend your island from invaders in The Island Combat! Use slow-motion combat skills to control time and protect your home from treasure hunters seeking the ancient pirate treasure. Will you rise to the challenge?",
